(7694307, 1261461, 4008, '<td valign="top">A bit too much colour, too busy for me.<br/>And a few minor faults in the editing:<br/>* left and below the tail of the yellow bird. a solid green patch with something (a leave?) in focus<br/>* the way the red bird holds the branch with left leg does not seem right<br/>* orange edges around the beak and head of the blue bird</td>', 'A bit too much colour, too busy for me.And a few minor faults in the editing:* left and below the tail of the yellow bird. a solid green patch with something (a leave?) in focus* the way the red bird holds the branch with left leg does not seem right* orange edges around the beak and head of the blue bird', '2021-05-15 17:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
